WEBVTT

00:10:59.875 --> 00:11:02.698
and "O-R-D-E-R" for order.

00:11:02.698 --> 00:11:04.228
That's chaos and order.

00:11:04.228 --> 00:11:05.904
We've all made order out of chaos.

00:11:05.904 --> 00:11:07.907
So ladies and gentlemen, the next time

00:11:07.907 --> 00:11:09.459
you find yourself with a puzzle,

00:11:09.459 --> 00:11:12.501
whether it's in your life or in your work,

00:11:12.501 --> 00:11:13.682
or maybe it's at the Sunday morning

00:11:13.682 --> 00:11:16.090
breakfast table with The New York Times,

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:19.932
remember, you are all wired to solve.

00:11:19.932 --> 00:11:21.524
Thank you.

00:11:21.524 --> 00:11:25.524
(Applause)